## Database Schema Changes

```sql
-- Add new statuses and columns to tasks_v2
ALTER TABLE tasks_v2 ADD COLUMN ready_commit_id TEXT;      -- Pre-rebase commit (for diagnostics)
ALTER TABLE tasks_v2 ADD COLUMN release_commit_id TEXT;    -- Post-rebase commit (for stuck release detection)
ALTER TABLE tasks_v2 ADD COLUMN release_started_at INTEGER;

-- Status values: draft | open | in_progress | ready_for_release | releasing | needs_resolution | closed
```

