## Status Flow

```
open → in_progress (claimed) → ready_for_release (agent done)
                                       ↓
                               releasing (orchestrator picked up)
                                       ↓
                    ┌──────────────────┴──────────────────┐
                    ↓                                      ↓
                 closed                           needs_resolution
                (success)                          (conflicts)
                                                       ↓
                                               ready_for_release
                                             (after agent resolves)
```

